{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106648","id":2532396408,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6W8U14","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106648","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106648.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106648.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106648","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106648/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106648/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106648/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4d879fc628006c15e0abcef0fa07b5fd257252d9","number":106648,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement window names for session restoration","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5005\r\n\r\nThis introduces a new window property the \"window name\" (term very much up for discussion) which is used to index a ConfigFile for window properties like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/76085 did but with an actual API instead of hardcoded names. Since setting the name is enough for restoration this can be exposed to user scripting/gdextension to give games access to easy window restoration.\r\n\r\n[Screencast_20250520_195106.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45ebd92a-a71d-478f-9ece-25df4901ccbd)\r\n\r\nTODOs I can think of as of now\r\n* ~~Better name for this property~~\r\n* Think of the timeline of window creation, currentlty for the name to work it must be set before `enter_child` is called\r\n* ~~This uses an `\"editor/\"` include in scene which isn't good. There should likely be multiple files anyway based on context but for now it's hardcoded to the project's `.godot`~~\r\n* Opening and closing the file is done quite frequently, maybe there's a better callback to set these window values?\r\n* On Wayland, this does not fully work (we cannot know or set many of these values), however the `xx-session-management` protocol would allow us to do precisely this if we pass the name to the DisplayServer.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id